{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_51_camping_soldier_ev_find.txt/1": "女王陛下！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_51_camping_soldier_ev_find.txt/2": "勇者大人！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_51_camping_soldier_ev_talk.txt/0": "怪物……不想被砍死的话，\r\n就立刻离开！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_51_camping_soldier_ev_talk.txt/1": "哦，女王陛下！\r\n欢迎，请自由通过！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_51_camping_soldier_ev_talk.txt/2": "哎呀，这真是\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]大人！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_51_camping_soldier_ev_talk.txt/3": "这个箱子不知道对您\r\n是否有用，但请务必收下！！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_521_fortune_telling_ev_talk.txt/1791": "是",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_521_fortune_telling_ev_talk.txt/1809": "否",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_522_samurai_ev_talk.txt/1613": "是",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_522_samurai_ev_talk.txt/1631": "否",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_523_cook_ev_talk.txt/1610": "是",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_523_cook_ev_talk.txt/1628": "否",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_524_creature_lover_ev_talk.txt/1623": "是",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_524_creature_lover_ev_talk.txt/1641": "否",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_525_hunter_ev_talk.txt/1716": "是",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_525_hunter_ev_talk.txt/1734": "否",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_526_king_ev_talk.txt/2126": "是",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_526_king_ev_talk.txt/2144": "否",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_53_lived_deadman_ev_find.txt/0": "呜喔喔喔喔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_548_samurai_probation_ev_talk.txt/0": "真是的，太弱了……。\r\n这样下去一辈子都强不起来！\r\n不过嘛，真到那时候，我会来救你的……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_548_samurai_probation_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>把头别向一边，\r\n低声\r\n嘟囔了一句。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_549_archer_ev_talk.txt/0": "要想变强，\r\n平日里的锻炼至关重要。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_549_archer_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>身姿凛然，\r\n如此说道。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_550_samurai_ev_talk.txt/0": "我超爱战斗！\r\n在拿性命相搏的时候，\r\n才最能感到自己活着！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_550_samurai_ev_talk.txt/1": "说这话的<TARGET>，\r\n看起来有些寂寞……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_551_sorcerer_ev_talk.txt/0": "你知道什么是阴阳道吗？\r\n那便是…………\r\n……水之五行…………",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_551_sorcerer_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>滔滔不绝地说个不停。\r\n看来一时半会儿\r\n不会结束……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_553_archer_pupil_ev_dead.txt/0": "呀啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_553_archer_pupil_ev_talk.txt/0": "我还只是个不成器的弟子。\r\n希望能早日成为\r\n得到师父认可的弓手！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_553_archer_pupil_ev_talk.txt/1": "嘴上这么说的<TARGET>，\r\n箭却一支支全射偏了……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_554_samurai_pupil_ev_dead.txt/0": "咕喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_554_samurai_pupil_ev_talk.txt/0": "真是的，太弱了……。\r\n这样下去一辈子都强不起来！\r\n不过嘛，真到那时候，我会来救你的……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_554_samurai_pupil_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>把头别向一边，\r\n低声\r\n嘟囔了一句。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_555_sorcerer_b_ev_dead.txt/0": "咕哈！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_555_sorcerer_b_ev_talk.txt/0": "阴阳道可厉害了！\r\n在很多方面都有用处，\r\n要不要花5,000,000拉比斯来学？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_555_sorcerer_b_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>不停招揽着你。\r\n明明已经拒绝了，却还不肯放弃。\r\n对方甚至说可以分期付款……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_565_sumo_wrestler_a_ev_dead.txt/0": "精彩！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_566_sumo_wrestler_b_ev_dead.txt/0": "精彩！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_567_sumo_wrestler_ev_dead.txt/0": "好痛啊……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_570_miss_chest_ev_talk.txt/0": "里面好像什么都没有。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_571_mimic_chest_ev_talk.txt/0": "里面好像什么都没有。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_571_mimic_chest_ev_talk.txt/1": "里面有魔物！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_572_normal_chest_ev_talk.txt/0": "里面好像什么都没有。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_572_normal_chest_ev_talk.txt/1": "里面有只较强的魔物！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_576_thief_a_ev_dead.txt/0": "咕哈！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_576_thief_a_ev_talk.txt/0": "走路时要留意四周。\r\n这世上\r\n到处都是坏人！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_576_thief_a_ev_talk.txt/1": "说着，<TARGET>\r\n环顾了一下四周。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_582_cyclops_ev_talk.txt/0": "(骨碌、骨碌、骨碌)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_582_cyclops_ev_talk.txt/1": "也许是放心不下周围，\r\n<TARGET>那只大眼珠\r\n正上下左右转个不停。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_583_succubus_ev_talk.txt/0": "呵呵呵……你想要我？\r\n呵呵……才不给呢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_583_succubus_ev_talk.txt/1": "这么说着的<TARGET>，\r\n吐着舌头笑了起来。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_584_mantichora_ev_talk.txt/0": "咕噜噜噜……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_584_mantichora_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n用温柔的目光\r\n从天上守护着你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_585_hunter_a_ev_talk.txt/0": "我原本也是人类。\r\n有一次走进地下城时……\r\n唔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_585_hunter_a_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>不愿\r\n再多说细节了……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_586_hunter_b_ev_talk.txt/0": "你也想试试吗？\r\n变成不死族！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_586_hunter_b_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>得意地说着，\r\n既不用上学，\r\n也不用工作！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_587_puppet_soldier_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n用空洞的眼神望向这边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_588_puppet_knight_ev_talk.txt/1": "从\r\n<TARGET>的眼中\r\n感受不到任何意志。但剑仍举着……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_589_puppet_king_ev_dead.txt/0": "啊啊啊——可恶啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_58_demon_lord_ev_dead.txt/0": "唔，啊啊啊……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_590_white_mantichora_ev_talk.txt/0": "咕噜噜噜……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_590_white_mantichora_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>低声咆哮着，\r\n警惕地观察四周。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_595_vampire_bat_ev_find.txt/0": "叽、叽——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_595_vampire_bat_ev_talk.txt/0": "叽叽叽！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_595_vampire_bat_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>似乎很想吸血，\r\n一直紧紧盯着这边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_596_grizzly_ev_talk.txt/0": "嗷呜——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_596_grizzly_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>似乎想玩，\r\n一直望着这边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_597_black_pegasus_ev_find.txt/0": "咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_597_black_pegasus_ev_talk.txt/0": "啪嗒、啪嗒、啪嗒！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_597_black_pegasus_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>威风凛凛地\r\n展开了双翼。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_598_black_unicorn_ev_find.txt/0": "咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_598_black_unicorn_ev_talk.txt/0": "哒、哒、哒！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_598_black_unicorn_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n轻快地四处奔跑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_599_white_tiger_ev_talk.txt/0": "咕噜噜噜……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_599_white_tiger_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>让美丽的毛皮随风飘动，\r\n一边警戒四周\r\n一边踱步。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_600_sabre_tiger_ev_talk.txt/0": "咕噜噜噜……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_600_sabre_tiger_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>靠了过来。\r\n但看见那长长的獠牙，\r\n还是让人害怕……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_604_evil_eye_ev_find.txt/0": "叽、叽——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_604_evil_eye_ev_talk.txt/0": "吱——吱——吱！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_604_evil_eye_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>绕着四周\r\n一圈圈飞个不停。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_605_flying_bomb_ev_find.txt/0": "叽、叽——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_605_flying_bomb_ev_talk.txt/0": "吱——吱——吱！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_605_flying_bomb_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>愉快地笑着，\r\n飞来飞去。\r\n老实说，真瘆人……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_606_dragonewt_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎啊啊啊～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_606_dragonewt_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>笑着\r\n向这边敬礼。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_607_armor_dragonewt_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎啊啊啊～！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_607_armor_dragonewt_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>举起长剑，\r\n表达敬意。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_damage.txt/0": "嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_damage.txt/1": "嘎啊 嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_damage.txt/2": "不　要　不　要",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_damage.txt/3": "嘎啊啊啊啊啊啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_damage.txt/4": "嘎……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_find.txt/0": "不　不　不、不要拔我！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘣、嘣、嘣——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_608_mandragora_a_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n一边摇头，\r\n一边开心地跳着舞。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_damage.txt/0": "嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_damage.txt/1": "嘎啊 嘎啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_damage.txt/2": "不　要　不　要",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_damage.txt/3": "嘎啊啊啊啊啊啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_damage.txt/4": "嘎……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎啊 嘎啊 嘎啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_609_mandragora_b_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n露出阴森的笑容望向这边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_60_demon_lord_ev_appear.txt/0": "附近出现了堕天使……\r\n看来她被\r\n\\c[52]$tmp2层结界\\c[0]守护着……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_60_demon_lord_ev_darkness.txt/0": "堕天使的气息消失了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_60_demon_lord_ev_dead.txt/0": "唔，啊啊啊……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_613_siren_ev_talk.txt/0": "啾！啾！啾！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_613_siren_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n温柔地微笑着。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_614_high_witch_ev_find.txt/0": "找到你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_614_high_witch_ev_talk.txt/0": "我、我才不是\r\n因为喜欢你才……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_614_high_witch_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n害羞地这么说道。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_619_armor_zombie_ev_talk.txt/0": "(咔嗒、咔嗒咔嗒咔嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_619_armor_zombie_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n神气十足地走着。\r\n明明是一具尸体，却还挺精神……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_620_skeleton_armor_ev_talk.txt/0": "(嘎嗒、嘎嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_620_skeleton_armor_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n犹犹豫豫地举着剑。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_621_skeleton_archer_ev_talk.txt/0": "(咔嗒、咔嗒咔嗒咔嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_621_skeleton_archer_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n高兴地拉开了弓。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_622_skeleton_gunner_ev_talk.txt/0": "(咔嗒、咔嗒咔嗒咔嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_622_skeleton_gunner_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>望着枪，\r\n一副陶醉的表情，\r\n沉浸其中。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_623_living_armor_ev_talk.txt/0": "(嘎嗒、嘎嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_623_living_armor_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n举起长剑，\r\n表达骑士的誓言。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_624_dullahan_ev_talk.txt/0": "(嘎嗒、嘎嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_624_dullahan_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n被头盔的重量\r\n压得摇摇晃晃。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_625_shadow_armor_ev_talk.txt/0": "(嘎嗒、嘎嗒……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_625_shadow_armor_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>似乎正望向这边，\r\n但周身漆黑，\r\n什么也看不清……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_628_stone_golem_ev_find.txt/0": "吼喔喔喔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_628_stone_golem_ev_talk.txt/0": "(咚嘎啊啊啊——！)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_628_stone_golem_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n被石头绊倒摔了一跤。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_629_iron_golem_ev_find.txt/0": "吼喔喔喔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_629_iron_golem_ev_talk.txt/0": "(咔嗒！)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_629_iron_golem_ev_talk.txt/1": "一只小鸟从\r\n<TARGET>身边逃走，\r\n他似乎很失望……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_630_dragon_a_ev_find.txt/0": "嘎喔喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_630_dragon_a_ev_talk.txt/0": "(哔叽——！)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_630_dragon_a_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>周围\r\n冻得闪闪发光！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_631_dragon_b_ev_find.txt/0": "嘎喔喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_631_dragon_b_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎喔喔喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_631_dragon_b_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>也许是想嬉闹，\r\n咧着嘴咚咚地走过来。\r\n还没玩就要被压扁了……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_632_dragon_c_ev_find.txt/0": "嘎喔喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_632_dragon_c_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘎喔喔喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_632_dragon_c_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>朝着天空\r\n发出一声长啸，\r\n表达着友情。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_633_troll_ev_find.txt/0": "布喔喔喔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_633_troll_ev_talk.txt/0": "我——喜欢——你！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_633_troll_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>\r\n张大嘴笑着。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_635_ogre_ev_find.txt/0": "布喔喔喔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_635_ogre_ev_talk.txt/0": "我——要和——你玩！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_635_ogre_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>挥舞着剑。\r\n实在没法\r\n陪他一起玩。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_636_titan_ev_find.txt/0": "布喔喔喔……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_636_titan_ev_talk.txt/0": "(咚——！)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_636_titan_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>每走一步，\r\n大地都会震动。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/0": "我觉得你最好快点离开。\r\n这片村落……\r\n想必也离终结不远了吧……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/1": "(咦……裸体？)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/2": "呃，你是丧尸……对吧？\r\n看起来相当温顺，\r\n外面还有像你这样的丧尸吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/3": "哎呀，你难道是\r\n人类之国的大人物？\r\n很高兴能被你注意到。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/4": "从外面来的客人，\r\n可真稀奇。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/5": "对了，我来治好你吧。\r\n精灵很擅长治疗的理术哦！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/6": "HP与EN恢复了999！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_66_elf_ev_talk.txt/7": "那么，加油哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_find.txt/0": "胆敢侵扰村落者，绝不宽恕。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/0": "咦？……衣服……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/1": "咳哼！！\r\n这里是精灵的隐秘村落。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/2": "真、真是不明人士……！\r\n若想侵扰村落，我们绝不留情。\r\n立刻离开！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/3": "这里是精灵族的隐秘村落。\r\n高贵之人，您来我们这里\r\n有何贵干？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/4": "这里是精灵族的隐秘村落。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/5": "……我们与山共生，\r\n也与山同死。\r\n没有离开此地的打算。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/6": "人类之国的勇者啊。\r\n事情办完后，\r\n就请离开吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_67_elf_leader_ev_talk.txt/7": "(为什么裸着……人类真让人不懂……)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_68_elf_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "在外面的世界，\r\n那种打扮很流行吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_68_elf_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "你是从外面来的吧。\r\n本村的物品……\r\n要不要买点什么？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_68_elf_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "谢谢。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_704_mamuru_ev_talk.txt/438": "购买",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_704_mamuru_ev_talk.txt/456": "暂时不用",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_705_monomi_ev_talk.txt/254": "去跑腿",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_705_monomi_ev_talk.txt/283": "暂时不用"
}
